WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.047
- So, wait, you were in
Meghan Trainor's last,

00:00:02.047 --> 00:00:02.947
"Made You Look," the hit.
- Oh yes.

00:00:02.947 --> 00:00:04.373
- Yes.
- Yes. Yeah.

00:00:04.373 --> 00:00:06.067
(audience applauds)
- I saw that and I was like,

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:07.440
"Wait, I didn't know
y'all knew each other."

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.700
I had no idea.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:09.913
- Yeah, it was-
- How did that happen?

00:00:09.913 --> 00:00:12.270
- [Scott Hoying] It's
a crazy story actually.

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.550
We were acquaintances and we
texted sometimes and stuff,

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.320
and when we got engaged
actually, Mark and I,

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.150
she texted me, "Congratulations."

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:18.983
- [Kelly] That's nice.

00:00:18.983 --> 00:00:19.816
- And I was like, "Thank you so much.

00:00:19.816 --> 00:00:20.670
What have you been up to?

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:21.503
I haven't talked to you in forever."

00:00:21.503 --> 00:00:22.560
And she's like, "I'm working on music.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:23.393
Do you wanna hear anything?"

00:00:23.393 --> 00:00:24.630
And I was like, "Yes, send everything."

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.463
She sent a couple songs.

00:00:25.463 --> 00:00:26.850
"Made You Look" and "Bad For Me."

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:27.840
- Yeah.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.210
- I was like, "Made You Look is a smash".

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.043
I was blown away.

00:00:31.043 --> 00:00:31.876
She's amazing.
- Yeah.

00:00:31.876 --> 00:00:34.050
- And then "Bad For
Me", I've been producing

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.940
and writing a lot

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.980
and so I, for fun, just put a choir on it

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.435
and I was like, "If you want
a choir version, here you go."

00:00:40.435 --> 00:00:42.120
- I love that.
- And she loved it.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:43.740
She's like, "I'm gonna
use this for the album

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:44.970
and also come over tomorrow"

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:48.300
and so (laughs) we started
working together a lot

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.350
and she's amazing.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.360
- I love how organic that is.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.340
People didn't put people together.

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:54.300
It happened to happen.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.440
That's cool.
- Yeah.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.300
She's so hands-on with
the music she makes.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.200
It's really amazing.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.430
- Yeah.
- And I just really

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:00.300
respect that.
- And you were right,

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.507
it is a big hit.

00:01:01.507 --> 00:01:02.940
"Made You Look".
- It is a smash.

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:03.773
- Yeah, you were right.

00:01:03.773 --> 00:01:04.606
I'm gonna send you

00:01:04.606 --> 00:01:06.060
all my music.
(Scott laughs)

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:07.326
If you're the guy that knows (laughs).

00:01:07.326 --> 00:01:08.940
- (laughs) No, I'm not
the guy that knows at all.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:11.040
It was just so obviously a smash (laughs).

